  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First release on NuGet. The byteshelf command works with a ByteShelf server from a terminal: shelves, files and directories, find and find-duplicates, the trash, share and upload links (link list, link revoke), encryption with a password that never leaves the machine, users, keys and replication. With --mcp it serves the same file operations to an agent as an MCP server. Made for ByteShelf server 2.1.0. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/byte-shelf/blob/cli-v2.1.0/ByteShelf.Cli/README.md",
